in every metastatic patient were annotated by NIH's DAVID tool. Genes belonging to selected GO categories with a significant number of differentially expressed genes are shown. <italic>Overall_FC</italic>, the fold change in the mean expression value of all metastatic samples compared to the primary samples;<italic>FC_P1, FC_P2, FC_P3, FC_P4</italic>; a patient-specific median expression value was calculated using all the samples from each patient. This was compared to the median value for the primary tumors. Patient P4 had only sample and this was considered the median.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>